+<section class="wrap hero" aria-labelledby="page-title"><span class="eyebrow">Simple, flexible pricing</span><h1 id="page-title">Good conversations.<br>Clear pricing.</h1><p>Everything your team needs to stay in sync. Start free, then grow at your own pace.</p><div class="billing"><span>Pay monthly</span><div class="switch" role="group" aria-label="Billing frequency"><button type="button" id="monthly" aria-pressed="true">Monthly</button><button type="button" id="yearly" aria-pressed="false">Yearly</button></div><span class="save">Save 20%</span></div></section>
+<section class="wrap plans" id="plans" aria-label="Pricing plans">
+<article class="card"><h2 class="plan-name">Free</h2><p class="plan-desc">A better way for small teams to talk.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-monthly="0" data-yearly="0">$0</span><span class="unit">/ user / month</span></div><p class="bill-note">Free forever</p><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Start%20with%20Relay%20Free">Get started</a><div class="rule"></div><p class="includes">What’s included</p><ul class="features"><li><span class="check">✓</span>Unlimited 1:1 and group messages</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Up to 10 team members</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>5 GB file storage</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>90-day message history</li></ul></article>
