+<article class="card"><h2 class="plan-name">Business</h2><p class="plan-desc">Advanced tools and support for growing teams.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-monthly="15" data-yearly="12">$15</span><span class="unit">/ user / month</span></div><p class="bill-note" data-note="business">Billed monthly</p><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Talk%20to%20Relay%20Sales">Talk to sales</a><div class="rule"></div><p class="includes">Everything in Team, plus</p><ul class="features"><li><span class="check">✓</span>Unlimited file storage</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Advanced admin controls</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Single sign-on (SSO)</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Data export and retention</li><li><span class="check">✓</span>Priority support</li></ul></article>
