+<section class="wrap section" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="faq-title">Frequently asked questions</h2><p>Still curious? Here are a few quick answers.</p></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Yes. Team includes a free trial, and you can use the Free plan for as long as you like. No credit card is needed to get started.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing to save 20% on each paid plan. The displayed monthly equivalent is billed as one annual payment.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change or cancel my plan?</summary><p>Yes. You can change plans or cancel at any time. If you cancel a paid plan, you keep access through the end of your billing period.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when my team grows?</summary><p>Add members whenever you need. Paid plans scale with your team, and you can move to Business for advanced controls and support.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help setting up Relay?</summary><p>Business customers get priority support. Any team can reach us at hello@relay.example for help getting started.</p></details></div></section>
